  "notes": "Neutral mid-tier state (proposal). India and Pakistan should be mutually exclusive clients with a long lockout. Proposal: India does NOT hire PMCs for operations inside Kashmir (sovereignty); contracts are overseas evacuation, maritime and counter-terror work. Real-world: April 2025 Pahalgam attack and May 2025 India-Pakistan conflict; India-China border disengagement deal October 2024.",
